  "_comment": [
    "The claim catalogue: the closed list of names the pipeline may put in canonicalClaim,",
    "so that a spreadsheet column can be grouped and counted. The original engagement used a",
    "few hundred client-defined categories exported from the firm's own standard-claims",
    "workbook; this is a fictional, shorter list covering the same domain — civil real-estate",
    "litigation: lot and unit purchase contracts, rescission, restitution, charges and fees.",
    "It is passed to the model as prompt text rather than as a schema enum: a several-hundred",
    "value enum bloats constrained decoding and turns every near-miss into a hard validation",
    "failure of the whole case. The model chooses; code repairs the spelling afterwards."
